# Suites and trials that the ESP32-S3_raw trial target does not run, each with its reason.
# A skipped suite or trial is reported as skipped, never as passed. Keep the reasons honest:
#   target: -- the board target cannot run it (a missing runtime, no OS, a hardware limit)
#   driver: -- the board trial driver does not handle this suite's layout yet
#
#   <suite>                 <reason>     the whole suite
#   <suite>/<trial-stem>    <reason>     one trial
#
# Sub-suites (subdirectories with their own Makefile, e.g. under error_enforcement_addition) are
# skipped by the driver automatically and reported as such; they need no entry here.

actor_stacks_addition            target: actor stacks are fixed blocks on the board (no demand paging); the suite measures page-granular growth and release
actors_addition/string_concat_cast_stress          target: 10,000 distinct strings on the ~300 KB bump heap (the host frees nothing either, but has gigabytes)
actors_addition/aggregate_return_in_actor_keeps_stack  target: 100,000 casts queued before the receiver runs (main never yields while sending); 4.8 MB of message nodes on a ~300 KB heap
compiler_addition/substring_utf8_cursor          target: ~940 KB of never-freed intermediate strings on a ~170 KB heap (the host frees no strings either)
generic_modules_addition/two_generic_collections_record_round_trip  target: ~18.5 KB heap left after code/bss/main's stacks; see esp32s3_memory_budget_plan.md
generic_modules_addition/two_generic_collections_round_trip         target: ~18.5 KB heap left after code/bss/main's stacks; see esp32s3_memory_budget_plan.md
memory_region_addition/region_chain_free_walked        target: three 1.6 MB buffers (200000 int64) per region on a ~170 KB heap (untouched pages cost nothing on the host)
memory_region_addition/region_move_conditional         target: a 200000-int64 (1.6 MB) buffer on a ~170 KB heap (untouched pages cost nothing on the host)
memory_region_addition/region_move_pass_and_return     target: a 200000-int64 (1.6 MB) buffer on a ~170 KB heap (untouched pages cost nothing on the host)
memory_region_addition/region_move_pass_no_return      target: a 200000-int64 (1.6 MB) buffer on a ~170 KB heap (untouched pages cost nothing on the host)
memory_region_addition/region_scope_loop_release       target: a 200000-int64 (1.6 MB) buffer on a ~170 KB heap (untouched pages cost nothing on the host)
ffi_addition                     target: no C runtime on bare metal (foreign calls)
warning_enforcement_addition     target: builds C wrapper archives (FFI fixtures)
ordered_data_structures          driver: its shared stdlib build and leaf layout are not handled yet
